<section id="sb-tax-area" class="sb-tax" aria-labelledby="sb-tax-title">
  <div class="sb-ws-section-head"><div><span class="sb-ws-section-id">CONTROL FISCAL · TRIMESTRES</span><h2 id="sb-tax-title">IVA e IRPF, bajo control.</h2></div></div>
  <p class="sb-tax__lead">Aquí apuntas las <b>facturas que ya has emitido legalmente por otro medio</b> y decides qué IVA y gastos soportados son deducibles. No se incluyen los borradores ni se presenta ninguna declaración automáticamente.</p>
  <div class="sb-tax__filters">
    <label>AÑO FISCAL<select id="sb-tax-year"></select></label>
    <label>TRIMESTRE<select id="sb-tax-quarter"><option value="1">1.º · Enero-marzo</option><option value="2">2.º · Abril-junio</option><option value="3">3.º · Julio-septiembre</option><option value="4">4.º · Octubre-diciembre</option></select></label>
    <button id="sb-tax-refresh" type="button">Actualizar ↻</button>
    <button id="sb-tax-csv" type="button">Exportar CSV ↓</button>
  </div>
  <div class="sb-tax__metrics">
    <article><span>IVA DE FACTURAS EMITIDAS</span><strong id="sb-tax-vat-out">—</strong></article>
    <article><span>IVA DEDUCIBLE MARCADO</span><strong id="sb-tax-vat-in">—</strong></article>
    <article><span>DIFERENCIA DE IVA</span><strong id="sb-tax-vat-balance">—</strong></article>
    <article><span>IRPF RETENIDO EN FACTURAS</span><strong id="sb-tax-retained">—</strong></article>
    <article><span>BASE DE FACTURAS DEL TRIMESTRE</span><strong id="sb-tax-base">—</strong></article>
    <article><span>RENDIMIENTO ORIENTATIVO ACUMULADO DEL AÑO</span><strong id="sb-tax-profit">—</strong></article>
  </div>
  <div class="sb-tax__notice" role="note">
    <strong>Control orientativo, NO autoliquidación</strong>
    <p>La diferencia de IVA no incorpora compensaciones anteriores, prorrata, inversión del sujeto pasivo ni otros regímenes especiales. El resultado de IRPF no es tu cuota de Renta ni el modelo 130. Los importes de gastos solo se descuentan si los marcas manualmente y pueden requerir amortización o ajustes fiscales.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="sb-tax__head">
    <div><h3>Facturas realmente emitidas</h3><p>Transcribe su número fiscal real, el devengo y el desglose. No se crea ni se envía una factura al cliente.</p></div>
    <button class="sb-ops__primary" id="sb-tax-new" type="button">+ Registrar factura emitida</button>
  </div>
  <div id="sb-tax-invoices" class="sb-tax__list" aria-live="polite">Cargando facturas anotadas…</div>
  <div class="sb-tax__head">
    <div><h3>Gastos: revisar deducciones</h3><p>Se muestran los gastos que ya has guardado. Introduce cuánto IVA soportado y qué base del gasto consideras deducibles; por defecto ambos son 0 €.</p></div>
    <a href="/acceso/panel/gastos/" class="sb-tax__link">+ Nuevo gasto ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div id="sb-tax-expenses" class="sb-tax__list" aria-live="polite">Cargando gastos…</div>
  <p id="sb-tax-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sb-tax__status"></p>
  <p class="sb-tax__foot">Las facturas de anticipo computan cuando se recibe el anticipo; una factura final tras anticipo registra <b>solo la base e IVA adicionales</b> que no se declararon antes. No registres dos veces la misma operación. Las rectificativas y operaciones especiales requieren revisión individual.</p>
</section>
<dialog id="sb-tax-dialog" class="sb-ops-dialog sb-tax__dialog" aria-labelledby="sb-tax-form-title">
  <div class="sb-ops-dialog__head"><div><span>CONTROL INTERNO · NO EMITE FACTURAS</span><h2 id="sb-tax-form-title">Anotar factura ya emitida.</h2></div><button type="button" id="sb-tax-close" class="sb-ops-dialog__close" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button></div>
  <form id="sb-tax-form">
    <div class="sb-ops-form">
      <label>Cliente <b>*</b><select required name="client_id"><option value="">Cargando…</option></select></label>
      <label>Número REAL de la factura <b>*</b><input name="reference" maxlength="100" placeholder="Ej. F-2026-0001" required/></label>
      <label>Tipo <b>*</b><select name="kind" required><option value="ordinaria">Ordinaria</option><option value="simplificada">Simplificada (máx. 400 €)</option><option value="anticipo">Anticipo cobrado</option><option value="final">Final, descontando anticipo</option></select></label>
      <label>Fecha de factura <b>*</b><input type="date" name="issue_date" required/></label>
      <label>Fecha de devengo de IVA <b>*</b><input type="date" name="tax_date" required/></label>
      <label class="sb-ops-form__wide">Servicio / concepto <b>*</b><input name="description" maxlength="300" placeholder="Diseño web, logotipo, anticipo… (solo lo facturado en este documento)" required/></label>
      <label>Base imponible de ESTA factura (€) <b>*</b><input name="base" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required placeholder="500,00"/></label>
      <label>IVA de esta factura<select name="vat_bps"><option value="2100">21 %</option><option value="1000">10 %</option><option value="400">4 %</option><option value="0">0 %</option></select></label>
      <label>IRPF de ESTA factura (%) <b>*</b><input name="withholding" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" required placeholder="Escribe 0, 7, 15…"/></label>
      <p class="sb-ops-form__note">IRPF sin configurar por defecto: debes elegir manualmente 0 % si no procede, o el porcentaje fiscal confirmado. Se calcula sobre la base sin IVA.</p>
      <div class="sb-tax__preview sb-ops-form__wide"><span>IVA calculado: <b id="sb-tax-preview-vat">—</b></span><span>IRPF retenido: <b id="sb-tax-preview-irpf">—</b></span><span>Neto de factura: <b id="sb-tax-preview-total">—</b></span></div>
      <label class="sb-ops-form__wide">Notas internas<textarea name="notes" maxlength="1000" rows="2" placeholder="Referencia a la factura del anticipo anterior, aclaraciones…"></textarea></label>
    </div>
    <div class="sb-ops-form__actions"><button type="button" id="sb-tax-cancel">Cancelar</button><button type="submit" id="sb-tax-save" class="sb-ops__primary">Guardar anotación</button></div>
    <p class="sb-ops-form__error" id="sb-tax-form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
  </form>
</dialog>
<style is:global>
  .sb-tax{margin:32px 0;padding:28px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.21);border-radius:25px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.11),rgba(255,255,255,.04));color:#f7f8fa}
  .sb-tax__lead,.sb-tax__head p,.sb-tax__notice p,.sb-tax__foot{color:#c5c7d1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}
  .sb-tax__filters{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}
  .sb-tax__filters label{display:grid;gap:7px;color:#c8cbd1;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .sb-tax__filters select,.sb-tax__filters button,.sb-tax__mini-form input{color:#f8f9fc;background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;font:inherit}
  .sb-tax__filters option{color:#111}
  .sb-tax__filters button{font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}
  .sb-tax__metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:20px 0}
  .sb-tax__metrics article{background:rgba(255,255,255,.085);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.19);border-radius:17px;padding:19px;display:grid;gap:12px;min-width:0}
  .sb-tax__metrics article span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.055em;color:#c5c7cf;font-weight:750}
  .sb-tax__metrics article strong{font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(21px,2vw,29px);letter-spacing:-.04em;word-break:break-word}
  .sb-tax__notice{border-radius:14px;background:rgba(235,210,117,.09);border:1px solid rgba(240,215,138,.27);padding:15px 18px;margin:16px 0 31px}
  .sb-tax__notice strong{color:#f7e6b1;font-size:12px}
  .sb-tax__notice p{margin:7px 0 0}
  .sb-tax__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin:32px 0 16px}
  .sb-tax__head h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(19px,2.4vw,26px);color:#fafafa}
  .sb-tax__head p{margin:7px 0 0}
  .sb-tax__head button{flex-shrink:0}
  .sb-tax__link{color:#fff!important;font-size:13px;text-decoration:underline!important}
  .sb-tax__list{display:grid;gap:10px;color:#cbd0d8;font-size:12px}
  .sb-tax__record{background:rgba(255,255,255,.075);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);padding:18px;border-radius:15px;display:grid;gap:10px}
  .sb-tax__record-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:15px}
  .sb-tax__record-top strong{color:#fff;font-size:15px}
  .sb-tax__record small{color:#bcc1cb;font-size:11px}
  .sb-tax__record-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .sb-tax__record-actions button{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:10px;color:#fff;font-size:11px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}
  .sb-tax__mini-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;align-items:end;gap:10px}
  .sb-tax__mini-form label{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:10px;color:#cbd0d8}
  .sb-tax__mini-form input{width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:12px}
  .sb-tax__mini-form button{padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);background:#ececf0;color:#131419;border-radius:11px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
  .sb-tax__status{font-size:12px;min-height:18px;margin-top:18px}
  .sb-tax__status.is-error{color:#ffc3c3}
  .sb-tax__foot{margin-top:24px}
  .sb-tax__dialog{max-width:720px;width:min(720px,96vw)}
  .sb-tax__preview{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:11px;font-size:12px}
  .sb-tax__preview b{color:#fff}
  @media(max-width:880px){.sb-tax__metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.sb-tax{padding:18px;margin:24px 0}.sb-tax__metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sb-tax__head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.sb-tax__mini-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<script>
  import {requestApi,getAll,el,formatEuro,formatDate,todayLocal,minorUnits} from '../../scripts/private-commerce.js';
  const node=id=>document.getElementById(id);
  const taxForm=node('sb-tax-form'),taxDialog=node('sb-tax-dialog');
  let taxData=null,taxEditing=null,taxBusy=false,taxClients=[];
  const taxNow=new Date(),years=node('sb-tax-year');
  for(let y=taxNow.getFullYear()+1;y>=2020;y--)years.add(new Option(String(y),String(y)));
  years.value=String(taxNow.getFullYear());
  node('sb-tax-quarter').value=String(Math.floor(taxNow.getMonth()/3)+1);
  const taxStatus=(message,error=false)=>{node('sb-tax-status').textContent=message;node('sb-tax-status').classList.toggle('is-error',error);};
  const txField=k=>taxForm.elements.namedItem(k);
  const euroInput=cents=>(cents/100).toFixed(2);
  const valOf=(v,place)=>minorUnits(String(v),place,'importe');
  function recText(parent,tag,value,klass){const n=el(tag,String(value),klass);parent.append(n);return n;}
  function showTaxInvoiceList(){
    const holder=node('sb-tax-invoices');holder.replaceChildren();
    if(taxData.truncated.invoices)recText(holder,'p','Hay más de 500 facturas en el periodo. Consulta tus registros antes de declarar.');
    if(!taxData.invoices.length){recText(holder,'p','No hay facturas emitidas anotadas en este trimestre. Los borradores NO cuentan.');return;}
    for(const item of taxData.invoices){
      const box=el('article',undefined,'sb-tax__record'),top=el('div',undefined,'sb-tax__record-top'),left=el('div');
      recText(left,'strong',item.reference+' · '+item.client_name);
      recText(left,'div',item.description);
      recText(left,'small',item.kind+' · Devengo '+formatDate(item.tax_date)+' · Emisión '+formatDate(item.issue_date));
      top.append(left,el('strong',formatEuro(item.total_cents)));
      box.append(top);
      recText(box,'small','Base '+formatEuro(item.base_cents)+' · IVA '+formatEuro(item.vat_cents)+' · IRPF '+formatEuro(item.withholding_cents)+' ('+(item.withholding_bps/100).toLocaleString('es-ES')+' %)');
      const actions=el('div',undefined,'sb-tax__record-actions');
      const edit=el('button','Editar anotación');edit.type='button';edit.addEventListener('click',()=>openTaxInvoice(item));actions.append(edit);
      const archive=el('button','Archivar');archive.type='button';archive.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
        if(taxBusy||!confirm('¿Archivar la anotación de '+item.reference+'? Dejará de sumar en el trimestre, pero se conservará en el historial técnico.'))return;
        taxBusy=true;try{await requestApi('/fiscalidad',{method:'DELETE',payload:{id:item.id}});taxStatus('Anotación archivada.');await loadTax();}
        catch(e){taxStatus(e.message,true);}finally{taxBusy=false;}
      });actions.append(archive);box.append(actions);holder.append(box);
    }
  }
  function showTaxExpenses(){
    const holder=node('sb-tax-expenses');holder.replaceChildren();
    if(taxData.truncated.expenses)recText(holder,'p','Más de 500 gastos: revisa también el módulo de Gastos.');
    if(!taxData.expenses.length){recText(holder,'p','No hay gastos registrados con fecha de este trimestre.');return;}
    for(const exp of taxData.expenses){
      const box=el('article',undefined,'sb-tax__record'),top=el('div',undefined,'sb-tax__record-top'),left=el('div');
      recText(left,'strong',exp.title+' · '+exp.supplier_name);
      recText(left,'small',formatDate(exp.expense_date)+(exp.document_ref?' · Justificante: '+exp.document_ref:' · Justificante no anotado'));
      top.append(left,el('strong',formatEuro(exp.gross_cents)));box.append(top);
      recText(box,'small','Base registrada: '+formatEuro(exp.base_cents)+' · IVA registrado: '+formatEuro(exp.vat_cents));
      const area=el('div',undefined,'sb-tax__mini-form');
      const makeInput=(label,cents,maxCents)=>{
        const l=el('label',label),i=el('input');i.type='number';i.min='0';i.max=euroInput(maxCents);i.step='0.01';i.value=euroInput(cents);l.append(i);area.append(l);return i;
      };
      const vat=makeInput('IVA deducible, revisado (€)',exp.vat_deductible_cents,exp.vat_cents);
      const irpf=makeInput('Gasto deducible IRPF, revisado (€)',exp.irpf_deductible_cents,exp.base_cents);
      const save=el('button','Guardar');save.type='button';save.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
        if(taxBusy)return;taxBusy=true;save.disabled=true;
        try{
          await requestApi('/fiscalidad',{method:'POST',payload:{action:'expense',expense_id:exp.id,vat_deductible_cents:valOf(vat.value,2),irpf_deductible_cents:valOf(irpf.value,2)}});
          taxStatus('Deducciones anotadas para '+exp.title+'.');await loadTax();
        }catch(e){taxStatus(e.message,true);}finally{taxBusy=false;save.disabled=false;}
      });
      area.append(save);box.append(area);holder.append(box);
    }
  }
  async function loadTax(){
    try{
      const q='?year='+encodeURIComponent(years.value)+'&quarter='+encodeURIComponent(node('sb-tax-quarter').value);
      taxData=await requestApi('/fiscalidad'+q);
      const map=[['sb-tax-vat-out','issued_vat_cents'],['sb-tax-vat-in','deductible_vat_cents'],['sb-tax-vat-balance','estimated_vat_balance_cents'],['sb-tax-retained','withheld_irpf_cents'],['sb-tax-base','issued_base_cents']];
      for(const [id,key] of map)node(id).textContent=formatEuro(taxData.summary[key]||0);
      node('sb-tax-profit').textContent=formatEuro(taxData.yearToDate.indicative_profit_cents||0);
      showTaxInvoiceList();showTaxExpenses();
    }catch(e){taxStatus('No se pudo consultar el resumen fiscal: '+e.message,true);}
  }
  function previewTax(){
    try{
      if(txField('base').value===''||txField('withholding').value==='')throw Error('Faltan datos');
      const base=valOf(txField('base').value,2);
      const vat=Math.round(base*Number(txField('vat_bps').value)/10000);
      const retained=Math.round(base*valOf(txField('withholding').value,2)/10000);
      node('sb-tax-preview-vat').textContent=formatEuro(vat);
      node('sb-tax-preview-irpf').textContent='−'+formatEuro(retained);
      node('sb-tax-preview-total').textContent=formatEuro(base+vat-retained);
    }catch{for(const id of ['sb-tax-preview-vat','sb-tax-preview-irpf','sb-tax-preview-total'])node(id).textContent='—';}
  }
  function openTaxInvoice(item=null){
    taxForm.reset();taxEditing=item?.id||null;
    node('sb-tax-form-error').hidden=true;
    node('sb-tax-form-title').textContent=item?'Editar anotación fiscal.':'Anotar factura ya emitida.';
    node('sb-tax-save').textContent=item?'Actualizar anotación':'Guardar anotación';
    for(const key of ['client_id','reference','kind','issue_date','tax_date','description','notes'])if(item)txField(key).value=item[key]||'';
    if(item){
      txField('base').value=euroInput(item.base_cents);
      txField('vat_bps').value=item.vat_bps;
      txField('withholding').value=euroInput(item.withholding_bps);
    }else{
      txField('issue_date').value=todayLocal();txField('tax_date').value=todayLocal();
      txField('withholding').value=''; // Obligación de introducir o confirmar explícitamente el 0%
    }
    previewTax();taxDialog.showModal();txField('reference').focus();
  }
  async function loadTaxClients(){
    try{
      taxClients=await getAll('/clientes');
      const s=txField('client_id');s.replaceChildren(new Option('Selecciona un cliente',''));
      for(const c of taxClients)s.add(new Option(c.display_name,c.id));
    }catch(e){taxStatus('No se pudieron consultar los clientes: '+e.message,true);}
  }
  taxForm.addEventListener('input',previewTax);taxForm.addEventListener('change',previewTax);
  taxForm.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{
    e.preventDefault();if(taxBusy)return;taxBusy=true;node('sb-tax-save').disabled=true;node('sb-tax-form-error').hidden=true;
    try{
      const payload={action:'invoice',client_id:txField('client_id').value,reference:txField('reference').value,
        kind:txField('kind').value,issue_date:txField('issue_date').value,tax_date:txField('tax_date').value,
        description:txField('description').value,notes:txField('notes').value,
        base_cents:valOf(txField('base').value,2),vat_bps:Number(txField('vat_bps').value),
        withholding_bps:valOf(txField('withholding').value,2)};
      if(payload.base_cents===0)throw Error('Indica una base positiva.');
      if(payload.kind==='final'&&!confirm('En una factura final tras anticipo, ¿has introducido SOLO la base e IVA todavía no facturados?'))throw Error('Revisa el anticipo antes de anotar la factura final.');
      if(taxEditing)payload.id=taxEditing;
      await requestApi('/fiscalidad',{method:taxEditing?'PATCH':'POST',payload});
      taxDialog.close();taxStatus('Anotación guardada. No se ha emitido ninguna factura ni presentado ninguna declaración.');await loadTax();
    }catch(e){node('sb-tax-form-error').textContent=e.message;node('sb-tax-form-error').hidden=false;}
    finally{taxBusy=false;node('sb-tax-save').disabled=false;}
  });
  function exportTaxCsv(){
    if(!taxData)return;
    const rows=[['Clase','Referencia / proveedor','Fecha devengo / gasto','Concepto','Base EUR','IVA repercutido EUR','IRPF retenido EUR','IVA deducible EUR','Gasto IRPF deducible EUR']];
    for(const r of taxData.invoices)rows.push(['Factura emitida',r.reference,r.tax_date,r.description,euroInput(r.base_cents),euroInput(r.vat_cents),euroInput(r.withholding_cents),'','']);
    for(const r of taxData.expenses)rows.push(['Gasto anotado',r.supplier_name,r.expense_date,r.title,euroInput(r.base_cents),'','',euroInput(r.vat_deductible_cents),euroInput(r.irpf_deductible_cents)]);
    const body='\uFEFF'+rows.map(row=>row.map(x=>'"'+String(x??'').replace(/"/g,'""')+'"').join(';')).join('\r\n');
    const blob=new Blob([body],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'});
    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='SouthBear-control-fiscal-'+taxData.period.year+'-T'+taxData.period.quarter+'.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
  }
  node('sb-tax-new').addEventListener('click',()=>openTaxInvoice());
  node('sb-tax-close').addEventListener('click',()=>taxDialog.close());
  node('sb-tax-cancel').addEventListener('click',()=>taxDialog.close());
  node('sb-tax-dialog').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===taxDialog)taxDialog.close();});
  node('sb-tax-refresh').addEventListener('click',loadTax);
  node('sb-tax-year').addEventListener('change',loadTax);
  node('sb-tax-quarter').addEventListener('change',loadTax);
  node('sb-tax-csv').addEventListener('click',exportTaxCsv);
  loadTaxClients();loadTax();
</script>
